        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: CKY, Violent Femmes\n- People: Deron Miller, Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, Matt Deis\n- Places: Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Pennsylvania\n- Products: Carver City\n- Topics: band formation, band membership, album identity\n\nFacts:\n- Violent Femmes is an American folk punk band from Milwaukee, Wisconsin, and it was initially active from 1980 to 2009.\n- CKY was formed in 1998 by lead vocalist and guitarist Deron Miller, guitarist and backing vocalist Chad I Ginsburg, and drummer Jess Margera.\n- CKY currently features Chad I Ginsburg, Jess Margera, and bassist Matt Deis.\n- Carver City is the fourth studio album by the Pennsylvania alternative metal band CKY.",
